    "removed_gap": "The exact algebraic native stableR-to-physical-leadingR binding and four-seed coefficient meaning are now proved, rather than left as premises.",
    "remaining_obligations": [
      "Kernel-checked interval/Taylor evaluation enclosing the exact seed functions on every claimed box. The existence of these exact meanings does not prove any printed native endpoint correct.",
      "Correctness of native floating-point operations, Taylor propagation, rounding and Bernstein tightening remains unproved. An independently sound rational interval evaluator can instead target the exact functions provided here.",
      "Horizontal and vertical actual side signs are still independent plus/minus sqrt(R) values. No matched-sign/non-Tao exhaustion, classification, exceptional-case or other finite physical branch coverage is proved by this extension.",
      "The original global target still needs complete normalization/cover integration and all remaining sectors; no box or sector closure is asserted here."
    ],
    "preservation": "The prior coefficient-bridge source packet, receipts and formalization record were not modified. This is a new scoped extension.",
    "failures_preserved": [
      "check-phase-evaluation-01 had a coercion elaboration failure; check-phase-evaluation-02 passes after proving the real-to-complex addition cast. No failed attempt receives proof credit."
    ],
